    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報351期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">6--月天氣漸漸熱，蟲thuā動物好生活！〈魚仔詩〉、〈UMA〉兩首詩以生物去聯想，uì無仝角度延伸，有情境ê描述、有議題ê探討。〈故宮揣生物〉講beh tshuā lán來去故宮tsit个看文物ê所在揣生物？讀--lueh你就知。6--月mā是學生畢業、歡喜期待歇熱ê日子，做伙來讀〈Tshuā學生去畢業旅行〉、〈來去金門行一tsuā〉、〈身心靈秘境——泰安溫泉〉，搶代先感受出去tshit-thô ê樂暢。無beh tshit-thô，你mā ē-sái〈行！看戲--looh！〉——tsit篇文章討論歌仔戲kap台語ê關係，thìng好kap〈為啥mi̍h beh用台語討論台灣文化？〉對照參考。台語文ê閱讀mā bē輸是一tsuā文化ê旅程，ǹg望逐家lóng thang揣著家己〈記憶中ê台語〉。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgN0CNhfqO3d30Kob8BYPrrtolaAsLYXQgSC_MlaaK2D9WIILbWlzweuxdwlu8BvusV0xtMYCybjgz40F9XC8dYjpWpxCBkQBom_Lc3Jvec3QTh2McL15ZntSaIlCOXLzCwp5Hi_vnxySrxeqJqTMhZBAR6aCvGgwypQSh8HhMks62WvJ67oyHAByomt90M/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E9%83%A8.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgN0CNhfqO3d30Kob8BYPrrtolaAsLYXQgSC_MlaaK2D9WIILbWlzweuxdwlu8BvusV0xtMYCybjgz40F9XC8dYjpWpxCBkQBom_Lc3Jvec3QTh2McL15ZntSaIlCOXLzCwp5Hi_vnxySrxeqJqTMhZBAR6aCvGgwypQSh8HhMks62WvJ67oyHAByomt90M/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1351%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF%E9%83%A8.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgjD5_l6xUD7retmBKB8wos7WRFknCak4GicPy6YeuPW7MytgdvGgESH2pfdKP9u6h00tKDFCnB85_K7